sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as API Gateway / Backend
    participant S as Downstream Service
    
    C->>A: Request API Endpoint
    A->>S: Forward Request
    S--xA: Error Response (e.g. 500 / Timeout)
    
    Note over A,S: Retry Strategy Initiated
    
    A->>S: Retry Attempt 1
    S--xA: Error Response
    
    A->>S: Retry Attempt 2 (Max Retries Reached)
    S--xA: Error Response
    
    Note over A: Construct standard Error Envelope
    
    A-->>C: 5xx / 4xx HTTP Response<br/>{ code, message, details }
